<title>USA: Babylon, N.Y., repriced, yields raised.</title>
<headline>Babylon, N.Y., repriced, yields raised.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Smith Barney Inc. said Monday that it repriced Babylon, N.Y., $18.2 million bond deal, raising yields.</p>
<p>TOWN OF BABYLON</p>
<p>RE: $18,200,000*</p>
<p>SUFFOLK COUNTY, NEW YORK</p>
<p>GENERAL OBLIGATION BONDS, SERIES 1994B</p>
<p>( THE &quot;BONDS&quot; )</p>
<p>VERBAL AWARD.</p>
<p>PLEASE NOTE REPRICING OF THE ISSUE.</p>
<p>THERE WILL BE A SECOND ORDER PERIOD IN THE FOLLOWING MATURITIES: 2000, 2001, 2002, 2003, 2004 TILL 11:30 AM THIS MORNING.</p>
<p>    MOODY'S: Aaa		   S&amp;P: AAA</p>
<p>AMBAC INSURED</p>
<p>    DATED: 09/20/1994	    FIRST COUPON: 01/15/1998</p>
<p>DUE: 01/15</p>
<p>INTEREST ACCRUES: 03/05/1997</p>
<p> MATURITY		AMOUNT*    COUPON	   PRICE</p>
<p>01/15/1998		2,200M    4.875 %	  3.75</p>
<p>						  (Approx. $ Price 100.937)</p>
<p>01/15/1999		2,300M    4.875 %	  4.125</p>
<p>						  (Approx. $ Price 101.323)</p>
<p>01/15/2000		2,500M    4.875 %	  4.325</p>
<p>						  (Approx. $ Price 101.458)</p>
<p>01/15/2001		2,600M    4.875 %	  4.50</p>
<p>						  (Approx. $ Price 101.309)</p>
<p>01/15/2002		2,700M    4.875 %	  4.65</p>
<p>						  (Approx. $ Price 100.962)</p>
<p>01/15/2003		2,900M    4.875 %	  4.75</p>
<p>						  (Approx. $ Price 100.626)</p>
<p>01/15/2004		3,000M    4.875 %	  4.85</p>
<p>						  (Approx. $ Price 100.138)</p>
<p>CALL FEATURES: NON-CALLABLE</p>
<p>* - APPROXIMATE SUBJECT TO CHANGE</p>
<p>The compliance addendum MSRB Rule G-11 will apply.</p>
<p>The award is expected Tuesday, March 4, 1997.</p>
<p>Delivery is expected on March 6, 1997.</p>
<p>This issue is book entry through DTC.</p>
<p>Smith Barney Inc.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
